// Pull request: #5945 new: add new rules for several AD related hacktools
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/5945
// Pull request author: swachchhanda000
// Change: new rule
// Title: HackTool - AIOSMB Suite Execution - Linux
// Sigma ID: 6e5d4c3b-2a1f-0e9d-8c7b-6a5f4e3d2c1b
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2026-04-21 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: discovery, lateral-movement, T1021.002, T1087.002
// Description: Detects execution of aiosmb command-line tools (asmbclient, asmbshareenum, asmbscanner,
//   asmbgetfile) used for asynchronous SMB enumeration, interactive file access, share and host
//   scanning, and lateral movement against Windows targets.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://github.com/skelsec/aiosmb
//   - https://github.com/n00py/Outpacket
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/6b9ade7935a13d35a57e75ff2587fbedcc53ef56/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_hktl_aiosmb.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains "asmbclient" or ProcessCommandLine contains "asmbshareenum" or ProcessCommandLine contains "asmbscanner" or ProcessCommandLine contains "asmbgetfile" or ProcessCommandLine contains "asmbcertreq") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+ntlm-password://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+ntlm-nt://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+sspi-ntlm://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos-password://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos-nt://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb2+kerberos-pfx://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb2+kerberos-pem://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb2+kerberos-certstore://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+sspi-kerberos://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos+ccache://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos+aes://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos+rc4://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+kerberos+pfx://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+negoex-pfx://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+negoex-certstore://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+quic+ntlm-password://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+quic+ntlm-nt://" or ProcessCommandLine contains "smb+quic+kerberos-password://")
